### 
### Module 4 Session 3 Endpoints
### ==============================

// 1. GET all enrollments 
GET {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. POST a new enrollment
# @name createEnrollment
POST {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "S-001",
  "courseCode": "CS-101"
}

###

### 3. GET a specific enrollment 
# This variable dynamically extracts the generated dynamic ID from your POST response object
@enrollmentId = {{createEnrollment.response.body.id}}

GET {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. DELETE an enrollment 
DELETE {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}

###

### 5. Test ProblemDetails Fault Envelope 
GET {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/error
Accept: application/json

### 6. Test ProblemDetails Fault Envelope (Exercise 6)
GET http://localhost:5049/api/error
Accept: application/json


### 7. Test OpenAPI Endpoint
GET {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json



### ==========================
### CRUD Endpoints  For STUDENT 
### ==========================

### 1. GET All Students (Should be empty initially)
GET {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

###


### 2. POST / Create a New Student
# @name createStudent
POST {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "10",
  "name": "abuki",
  "age": 22,
  "gpa": 3.8
}

###

### 3. GET Student by ID
GET {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/students/10
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. PUT / Update Student Details
PUT {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/students/10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Abuki Modified",
  "age": 23,
  "gpa": 3.9
}

###

### 5. Test Student Age Out of Range Exception (Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "S-002",
  "name": "Invalid Student",
  "age": 12,
  "gpa": 3.5
}


### ======================
### Course CRUD Endpoints
### ======================

### 1. GET All Courses
GET {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. POST / Create a New Course
# @name createCourse
POST {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CS-101",
  "title": "Introduction to Computer Science",
  "capacity": 30
}

###

### 3. GET Course by Code
GET {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/courses/CS-101
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. PUT / Update Course Capacity
PUT {{TMSApi_HostAddress}}/api/courses/CS-101
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Advanced Computer Science",
  "capacity": 45
}

###


